  "synonym_discrimination": {
    "words": [
      "style-n",
      "fashion-n"
    ],
    "note": "**Fashion** is what is popular at a particular time, especially in clothes (*the latest fashions*), and the business of making it. **Style** is a particular design or way of doing something (*a style of jacket*, *his style of teaching*), and also good taste (*she has style*). Something can be **in style** or **in fashion** with the same meaning."
  },
